<title>USA: Ross Stores raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Ross Stores raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, Calif. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ross Stores Inc said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.09 per share from $0.07.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable April 7 to shareholders of record March 10.</p>
</text>
